            "description": "Retrieves a list of all posts available in the API.\n\n**Method:** GET  \n**Endpoint:** `{{BASE_URL}}/posts`\n\n**Authentication:** Not required\n\n**Query Parameters:** None\n\n**Request Body:** None\n\n**Response:**  \nReturns a JSON array of post objects. Each object contains the following fields:\n\n| Field | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| userId | integer | ID of the user who created the post |\n| id | integer | Unique identifier of the post |\n| title | string | Title of the post |\n| body | string | Content/body of the post |\n\n**Example Response (200 OK):**\n\n``` json\n[\n  {\n    \"userId\": 1,\n    \"id\": 1,\n    \"title\": \"sunt aut facere repellat provident occaecati excepturi optio reprehenderit\",\n    \"body\": \"quia et suscipit\\nsuscipit recusandae consequuntur expedita et cum\\nreprehenderit molestiae ut ut quas totam\\nnostrum rerum est autem sunt rem eveniet architecto\"\n  }\n]\n\n ```\n\n**Status Codes:**\n\n- `200 OK` — Posts retrieved successfully."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar Post 1",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const Ajv = require('ajv');",
                  "const ajv = new Ajv();",
                  "",
                  "// 1. Validar o Status Code básico (Se o servidor respondeu com sucesso)",
                  "pm.test(\"Status code é 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// 2. Definir o Schema (O Contrato que a API prometeu seguir)",
                  "const contratoSchema = {",
                  "    \"type\": \"object\",",
                  "    \"required\": [\"userId\", \"id\", \"title\", \"body\"],",
                  "    \"properties\": {",
                  "        \"userId\": { \"type\": \"number\" },",
                  "        \"id\": { \"type\": \"number\" },",
                  "        \"title\": { \"type\": \"string\" },",
                  "        \"body\": { \"type\": \"string\" }",
                  "    }",
                  "};",
                  "",
                  "// 3. Executar a validação do contrato usando a biblioteca Ajv (nativa do Postman)",
                  "pm.test(\"Validar o Contrato da API (JSON Schema)\", function () {",
                  "    var dadosDaResposta = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (Array.isArray(dadosDaResposta)) {",
                  "        pm.expect(ajv.validate(dadosDaResposta[0], contratoSchema)).to.be.true;",
                  "    } else {",
                  "        pm.expect(ajv.validate(dadosDaResposta, contratoSchema)).to.be.true;",
                  "    }",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              }
            }
          ],
